      "versionNonce": 116988,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793789630470,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. L1 RAM Schema Validation (<1ms)\n2. Real-Time Consent Gate:\n   • Full Opt-in -> Full Pipeline\n   • Analytics Only -> Strip PII -> S3 Only\n   • Full Opt-out -> HTTP 204 Drop\n3. Async Batch Producer (linger 5-10ms, lz4)\n4. Zero DB & Zero Redis Dependency",
      "fontSize": 13.0,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. L1 RAM Schema Validation (<1ms)\n2. Real-Time Consent Gate:\n   • Full Opt-in -> Full Pipeline\n   • Analytics Only -> Strip PII -> S3 Only\n   • Full Opt-out -> HTTP 204 Drop\n3. Async Batch Producer (linger 5-10ms, lz4)\n4. Zero DB & Zero Redis Dependency",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
