      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793789630470,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Event Deduplication (event_id TTL 10m)\n2. Identity Resolution & Session Stitching (<150ms)\n3. Session-Scoped Features (UTM, Counters, Cart)\n4. Sliding Windows (1m-24h) & CEP Timers (RocksDB)\n5. Dynamic Segmentation Lifecycle (ENTER / EXIT)\n6. Sub-second Closed-Loop Survey Enrichment",
      "fontSize": 13.0,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
