      "originalText": "1. Event Deduplication (event_id TTL 10m)\n2. Identity Resolution & Session Stitching (<150ms)\n3. Session-Scoped Features (UTM, Counters, Cart)\n4. Sliding Windows (1m-24h) & CEP Timers (RocksDB)\n5. Dynamic Segmentation Lifecycle (ENTER / EXIT)\n6. Sub-second Closed-Loop Survey Enrichment",
